# Pinned spec artifacts, produced by the nxus-sdks pipeline — collapsed by
# default in GitHub reviews. openapi.json is ~10 MB; read the nxus-sdks
# spec/CHANGES.md for the human-readable diff instead. Never hand-edit these;
# re-pin them upstream.
#
# `linguist-generated=true` collapses the diff but keeps it textual, so local
# `git diff` and regen-check's `git diff --exit-code` still work normally.
#
# nxus_qbd/models/ is generated too, but it is gitignored, so it never reaches
# a diff in the first place.
spec/*.json    linguist-generated=true
